    "title": "Ron Holland Is One Rotation Change From a Leap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Glenn Kaplan ,\n1 days ago Ron Holland will be entering his third NBA season with the Detroit Pistons, and he is doing it on a team that just went 60-22 and claimed the No. 1 seed in the Eastern Conference. Holland came off the bench all of last season and is likely to open this one in the same spot. If Detroit is going to sit at the top of the East again, that bench role has to carry more weight. Read full article",
